desc:
A very useful material;
indispensable for both
hunting and daily life.

A monster organ with
tremendous freezing power;
turns its surroundings to ice.

These crests become rigid
when the beast is angry;
quantity indicates status.

A high quality scale carved
from an Astalos. Looks tough,
but is actually quite flexible.

Harder than Teostra Shell.
Looks like red-hot steel;
particularly eye catching.
